!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = age (years): 6
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = gender: Female
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = genetic condition: Snell Dwarf
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = diet: standard
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Isolated fibroblasts were transformed into iPSCs by lenti-viral vector (OKSM).
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Isolated fibroblasts were grown in DMEM with 20% FBS (37C, 5% CO2). IPSCs were grown with LIF and DMEM with 20% FBS (37C, 5% CO2)
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Whole blood was harvested, mixed with K2EDTA, mixed with lysis buffer and DNA was isolated from lysate. Fibroblasts and IPSCs were lysed and DNA was isolated from lysate.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Libraries were prepared using Reduced Representation Bisulfite Sequencing. Six to seven samples were pooled together using Illumina's TrueSeq Nano DNA LT adaptors.
!Sample_data_processing = Basecalls performed usingbcl2fastq 1.8.3.
!Sample_data_processing = Adapter removal and quality trimming were performed by using Trim Galore! v.0.4.0
!Sample_data_processing = Aligment performed by Bismark v0.14.0 with Bowtie 2. (-q -n 1 -k 2 --best --chunkmbs 512)
!Sample_data_processing = Methylation levels were determined as suggested by the Bismark program manual using the following parameters: bismark_methylation_extractor -p --multicore 10 --bedGraph --ample_memory --cytosine_report --genome_folder ./ $Sample.R1_val_1.fq.gz_bismark_pe.bam
